<article class="env-proof">
    <p>
      <strong>Proof.</strong>
      Let $S$ be a (small) set of morphisms of $\calC $ such that $\calC ^0$ is the full subcategory of $\calC $ spanned by the $S$-local objects. Then $\calD ^0$ is the full subcategory of $\calD $ spanned by the $f(S)$-local objects. 
      <span class="qed">$\square$</span>
    </p>
</article>